		"description": "<p>A common form of EMP weapon, these guns propel directed electromagnetic pulses. The weapon has a relatively high rate of fire, able to produce several pulses in quick succession, but their effective range is limited. These weapons were used for destroying mechs and other high-tech targets.</p><p>The profile for the EMP Repeater can be found in the Military Weapons Table at the start of this section. An EMP Repeater is a powered weapon, which recharges after a Bed rest. Non-robot characters cannot suffer Injury from EMP weapons.</p>",
